# P7 polish: the plugin engine parameters print with the MK66 units in the Tracker+ patch editor (PlugSynthVoice formatValue). The card holds
# pluck.plg and alco.plg (plus_flows.sh stages the logos card). Synth 1 steps to PLK as in *_logos.flow, F8 opens the patch editor, Down selects
# the second parameter of the first section (Pick Pos). plus_flows.sh reads the value text of the selected parameter afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_SYNTHTEXT, the
# synthtext line): the last one must be "Pick Pos = 35%", the MK66 text at its default (OG emu: synthfmt 0 Pick_Pos 0.35 = 35%).
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Plugin engine param units on Tracker+ (P7 polish)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

use boot-to-pattern
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
use goto-instrument
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth 1"
tap Down x4
wait 1500ms
expect text "PLK"
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
shot units-editor
tap Down
wait 1500ms
shot units-param
